@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
title 08 修改与版本超时竞争时序图 - 交互图
actor "顾客" as Customer
control "BookingService" as Booking
control "TimeoutWorker" as Worker
control "InventoryService" as Inventory
control "AuditService" as Audit
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
note over Booking,DB
请求先鉴权; 各分支均先锁酒店门禁再锁订单.
t在取得锁后读取, 超时条件严格为t>期限.
end note
alt 修改先持锁且本轮未过期
  Customer -> Booking : modify(order, expectedVersion=v)
  Booking -> DB : BEGIN, 锁订单, 校验版本/状态/期限
  Booking -> Inventory : 锁新旧键并验证净delta
  Inventory -> DB : 按固定顺序锁全部相关日
  alt 库存或业务校验失败
    Booking -> DB : ROLLBACK
    Booking -> Audit : 独立失败审计
    Booking --> Customer : 原订单/周期/版本不变
  else 修改可成功
    Booking -> DB : 写净delta及价格修订\nv+1, 待确认, waitingSince=t
    Booking -> DB : 插入新版本TimeoutJob
    Booking -> Audit : 同事务成功审计
    Booking -> DB : COMMIT
    Worker -> Booking : expire(order, targetVersion=v)
    Booking -> DB : 重新持锁读取
    Booking --> Worker : 旧版本, 跳过且不释放
  end
else 超时任务先持锁且t>期限
  Worker -> Booking : expire(order, targetVersion=v)
  Booking -> DB : BEGIN, 锁订单并复核版本及期限
  Booking -> Inventory : 释放全部住宿晚占用
  Booking -> Audit : 同事务超时成功审计
  Booking -> DB : 已取消及任务结果, COMMIT
  Customer -> Booking : modify(order, expectedVersion=v)
  Booking -> DB : 持锁读取已取消
  Booking -> Audit : 独立记录修改失败
  Booking --> Customer : STATE_CONFLICT, 不恢复旧单
else 修改先持锁但发现本轮已过期
  Customer -> Booking : modify(order, expectedVersion=v)
  Booking -> DB : BEGIN, 锁订单并发现t>期限
  Booking -> Inventory : 释放全部占用
  Booking -> Audit : 同事务记录超时取消
  Booking -> DB : COMMIT
  Booking -> Audit : 独立记录原修改被拒绝
  Booking --> Customer : ORDER_EXPIRED, 当前已取消
end
note over Booking,Worker
确认也执行同一过期检查.
恰好30分钟可确认; 已确认订单不按旧周期超时.
任何成功审计写入失败均回滚其业务事务.
end note
@enduml
